                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's....a part of HELP: THE GAME, you're helping somebody. I can't be too harsh on the game, given the story behind how it was made and what it was made for.\n\nPros:\n\n-Helping a worthy cause if purchased as part of HELP: THE GAME\n-Cute design, but not the cutest.\n-Working AI you can play against if you have nobody to play with \n\nNot-Pros (Sort of Cons):\n\n-AI has unlimited \"bumping\" power, never runs out of water to propel itself with; AI has distinct advantage\n-Not much depth, very simple (Bump them into the water by propelling yourself with a water gun, don't get bumped into the water, 3 lives, up to 4 players, a powerup here and [kinda] there)\n-Not very thrilling\n-NOT a game for hours (or even minutes) of entertainment\n\nSupporting HELP: THE GAME gets you a copy of this.",
